      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i just noticed something weird with my eye. like, i keep seeing these little flashes of light and some black spots floating around in my vision. it's kind of distracting but nothing too crazy, maybe i just spent too much time on my laptop today? do you think i just need some eye drops or maybe a break from screens?",
