      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk i dont really want to go to the doctor if i dont have to, it's always so expensive and takes forever. do u think it could just be like dry eyes or something? i have some old lubricant drops in my cabinet, would it be safe to just use those for a few days and see if the spots go away?",
